pact the way  that the opinions get written whether  they're more narrow or more sweeping um  and in particular how the dissents are  written for the future that's really  important of course to remember kimberly  thank you so much kimberly robinson  hopping on with us from bloomberg law to  give us instant insight into what the  briar's reported retirement means for  the balance of the supreme court

